"To find the value of 56 Drinkets in Trinkets, we need to convert all units to Trinkets. We know the following relationships:\n\n1. 1 Trinket = 4 Blinkets\n2. 3 Blinkets = 7 Blinkets\n\nFirst, let's convert Blinkets to Trinkets. Since 1 Trinket = 4 Blinkets, we can convert 3 Blinkets to Trinkets:\n\n\\[ 3 \\text{ Blinkets} = \\frac{3 \\text{ Blinkets}}{4 \\text{ Blinkets/Trinket}} = \\frac{3}{4} \\text{ Trinkets} \\]\n\nNow, we know that 3 Blinkets = 7 Blinkets. Therefore, we can convert 56 Drinkets to Trinkets:\n\n\\[ 56 \\text{ Drinkets} = 56 \\times \\frac{3}{4} \\text{ Trinkets/Drinket} = 42 \\text{ Trinkets} \\]\n\nThus, the value of 56 Drinkets in Trinkets is \\(\\boxed{42 Trinkets} \\)."
